        <mxCell id="J5zMkfzMNTRxlHXRm_2p-155" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;autosize=1;resizable=0;glass=0;shadow=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Lambda Responsibilities&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;postDisposalRequest&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Add metadata for new request&lt;br&gt;- Insert new record to the assets_disposal_table&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Add table attr &quot;status&quot; PENDING&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;postDisposalApproval&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Update table attr &quot;status&quot; Approved or Rejected&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Add metadata for approval&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Insert approval Item to asset_transfer_table&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- DELETE scheduler (if exist)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;postAcceptAsset&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;- Add metadata for asset received (date, sub)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Insert Item to asset_transfer_table&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;postDisposalCancel&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;- Add metadata for asset cancelled (date, sub)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Update table attr &quot;status&quot; CANCELLED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Insert&amp;nbsp; Item to asset_transfer_table&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- DELETE scheduler (if exist)&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;checkDisposalApprovalTimeout&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Check status of request (admin approved)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- If not, resend notification&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Expire after 2 attempts&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;assetDisposalApproval&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Update table attr &quot;status&quot; APPROVED or REJECTED&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;assetDisposalRequest&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Check asset to be transferred.&lt;br&gt;- Check who to notif&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;y based on asset tier&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Forward information to SNS topic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;assetDisposalCompletion&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Check asset to be transferred.&lt;br&gt;- Check who to notif&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;y based on asset tier&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Forward information to SNS topic to notify requestor/admin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;handleDisposalNotifications&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Check status event&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Update new notification event with metadata (created, id)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Update notifications table with new notification&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;getDisposalNotifications&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Sort notifications by sub&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Send notifications to frontend by sub&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Admin users see all transfers&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="740" width="340" y="-827" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="J5zMkfzMNTRxlHXRm_2p-157" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;autosize=1;resizable=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="20" x="320" y="-155" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FDUazGy5zb7ulTCKUIn2-35" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;autosize=1;resizable=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="20" x="630" y="-150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2juJ8t4o3zx5v-UaFW3N-649" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;autosize=1;resizable=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Notifications&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;notifyAdmin&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Notify approving admin of new diposal request&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;notifyRequestor &amp;amp; notifyRecipient&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Notify requestor asset disposal was approved or rejected&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;nofifyAdmin &amp;amp; notifyRequestor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- notify admin and requestor disposal was completed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;EventBridge&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scheduler&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Add schedule when new request is created INSERT: STATUS = PENDING&lt;br&gt;- Invoke lambda checkApprovalTimeout after 3 days, first attempt and again after 7 days.&lt;div&gt;- Lambda cancel the request after 7 days, update status = EXPIRED.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Pipes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Filter Options:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;- INSERT: PENDING&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- MODIFY: PENDING -&amp;gt; APPROVED | REJECTED&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- MODIFY: IN_TRANSIT -&amp;gt; COMPLETED&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- INSERT: invoke assetDisposalRequest&lt;br&gt;- MODIFY: invoke assetDisposalApproval&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- MODIFY: invoke assetDisposalCompletion&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="420" width="490" x="360" y="-827" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Y7d9bmQHhjZs_Nu0o15Q-3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;autosize=1;resizable=0;spacing=1;spacingRight=0;spacingLeft=0;labelPosition=center;verticalLabelPosition=middle;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;DynamoDB&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;transfer_table_attributes: (items in blue added on backend)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;request = {&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;transfer_id,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;transfer_created,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;status: PENDING&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;request_sub,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;approved_sub,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;recipient_sub,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;description,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;assetID,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;transfer_reason,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;location_from,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;location_to,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;expected_date,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;approval = {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;dateApproved,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;approvedBy: sub,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;status: APPROVED | REJECTED,&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;in_transit = {&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; dateCreated,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; inTransitSub,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; status: IN_TRANSIT&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; transferDate,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; transport:[company, courier, contractor, individual]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; name_of_transport,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; transportCost,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; invoice (attach if available)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; images (optionall)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;receipt = {&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;dateReceived,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;receivedBy: sub,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;status: RECEIVED&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;condition: [excellent, damaged], (radio buttons),&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;if&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt; &lt;/font&gt;damaged&lt;/font&gt; (provide details),&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;images (optional),&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;delivery_note (optional)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;notifications_table_attributes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;{&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;notification_id,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;status,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;sub,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;notification_date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
